  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "This recipe will make about 8 cups. Work in batches to best fit your blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Peel the bananas. Break into chunks and add to blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add almond milk, raspberries, blueberries, almond butter, and cinnamon to the blender."
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend on high speed for several minutes until smooth."
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide the smoothie between bowls and top with additional raspberries, blueberries, and almonds."
